===================
 dbt7-plot-results
===================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-plot-results** [option...]

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-plot-results** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) power test query
plotter.  It uses **gnuplot** to plot the query execution times from a
power test time statistics file.

OPTIONS
=======

-i CSV  Power test time statistics *csv* file.
-o PATH  Output directory, default the current directory.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-power-test**\ (1), **dbt7-report**\ (1),
**gnuplot**\ (1)
